# Copy this file to .env.local (already gitignored — never commit real keys)
# and fill in your own values.

# Required for the Tools / pharmacy-finder page (/tools) to work.
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/ and create a project (free).
# 2. Enable the "Places API" (legacy) under APIs & Services.
# 3. Create an API key under Credentials.
# 4. Restrict the key to the Places API for security, then paste it below.
# Google's free tier covers a generous number of monthly lookups before any
# billing kicks in — check current pricing on Google's site before heavy use.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Also for /tools — shows an actual visual map of nearby pharmacies.
# This is a DIFFERENT key from the one above, and it's meant to be public
# (the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix means it ships in the page's own code, visible to
# anyone) — you secure it differently, by restricting where it can be used:
# 1. In the same Google Cloud project, enable "Maps Embed API".
# 2. Create a second API key under Credentials.
# 3. Restrict it under "Application restrictions" -> "Websites" to your
#    site's domain (and http://localhost:3000/* while developing locally) —
#    this stops anyone else from using your key even though it's public.
# 4. Restrict its "API restrictions" to just "Maps Embed API".
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=

# --- Monetization (optional — the site works fine with none of these set) ---

# Shows a "compare prices with a free discount card" link on /tools once
# someone's found a nearby pharmacy — a natural fit, since that's the exact
# moment a discount-card referral is useful, not a bolted-on ad.
# 1. Apply at a pharmacy-discount affiliate program (e.g. GoodRx's affiliate
#    program, found via an affiliate network like Admitad or GetLasso).
# 2. Once approved, they give you a tracked link with your ID in it — paste
#    that FULL url below (not just an ID).
# Leave blank and the link simply doesn't render — nothing breaks.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PHARMACY_AFFILIATE_URL=

# Turns on Google AdSense site-wide once you're approved. AdSense reviews a
# live site with real content and a privacy policy before approving it (both
# already true here) — apply at https://adsense.google.com once the site has
# a real domain. Paste the "ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX" client ID they give you.
# Leave blank and no ad script loads at all.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID=
